message: "If you use this software, please cite it as below."
type: software
title: "Bone Data Manager"
abstract: >-
  Desktop and Android application for recording osteological and dental observations,
  one row per bone or tooth with automatic reference IDs, custom fields and Excel export.
  Optional team sync through each team's own Supabase server, with roles, offline work and
  conflict resolution.
